{"data": {"event": {"id": "f42601fb-a148-4a27-b9ce-bea71c4d5b40", "picture": null, "sessionType": "S\u00e9ances de cours", "sessionTypeColor": "#6545fa", "voting": null, "title": "Imagerie du patient traumatis\u00e9", "start": "2026-10-10T08:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T09:30+02:00", "objectives": ["<ul>", "\t<li data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"385\">", "\t<p data-end=\"556\" data-start=\"388\"><strong data-end=\"445\" data-start=\"388\">D\u00e9terminer la strat\u00e9gie d\u2019imagerie la plus appropri\u00e9e</strong> chez le patient traumatis\u00e9 thoracique, abdominal et pelvien en fonction du contexte clinique et h\u00e9modynamique.</p>", "\t</li>", "\t<li data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"557\">", "\t<p data-end=\"708\" data-start=\"560\"><strong data-end=\"641\" data-start=\"560\">Identifier en tomodensitom\u00e9trie inject\u00e9e les principales l\u00e9sions traumatiques</strong> int\u00e9ressant le thorax, les organes pleins abdominaux et le pelvis.</p>", "\t</li>", "\t<li data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"709\">", "\t<p data-end=\"882\" data-start=\"712\"><strong data-end=\"765\" data-start=\"712\">Reconna\u00eetre les signes scanographiques de gravit\u00e9</strong>, en particulier les atteintes vasculaires et les signes d\u2019h\u00e9morragie active n\u00e9cessitant une prise en charge urgente.</p>", "\t</li>", "\t<li data-end=\"1013\" data-start=\"883\">", "\t<p data-end=\"1013\" data-start=\"886\"><strong data-end=\"938\" data-start=\"886\">Appliquer une lecture syst\u00e9matique et structur\u00e9e</strong> des examens d\u2019imagerie afin de d\u00e9pister les l\u00e9sions associ\u00e9es ou occultes.</p>", "\t</li>", "\t<li data-end=\"1193\" data-start=\"1014\">", "\t<p data-end=\"1193\" data-start=\"1017\"><strong data-end=\"1095\" data-start=\"1017\">Int\u00e9grer les donn\u00e9es de l\u2019imagerie \u00e0 la prise en charge multidisciplinaire</strong>, en connaissant les limites diagnostiques et la n\u00e9cessit\u00e9 d\u2019une corr\u00e9lation clinico-radiologique.</p>", "\t</li>", "</ul>"], "onAir": null, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}, "broadcasts": {"items": []}, "room": {"id": "b2cdf3e0-ef93-4444-844a-94ea26aab669", "name": "252", "type": "ROOM"}, "schedule": {"items": [{"id": "cfcbe071-7fd1-46c4-95d8-af92b8bed940", "title": "Imagerie du traumatis\u00e9 thoracique", "start": "2026-10-10T08:30+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T08:45+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "CFCBE071-7FD1-46C4-95D8-AF92B8BED940"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "38033dac-76a8-4e2f-8764-86514261665a", "lastName": "Ruez Lantuejoul", "firstName": "Lea", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": {"url": "https://services.y-congress.com/congress/wspreview/getphoto.aspx?idPhoto=234993&t=1"}, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Grenoble"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}}, {"id": "7b2ca464-b342-4a35-bcba-93214b0c1cf8", "title": "Imagerie du traumatis\u00e9 h\u00e9patique et spl\u00e9nique", "start": "2026-10-10T08:45+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T09:00+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "7B2CA464-B342-4A35-BCBA-93214B0C1CF8"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "f88fdf90-02a9-4e72-9ce6-92e678dc90ef", "lastName": "Teyssier", "firstName": "Yann", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": null, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "Grenoble"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}}, {"id": "f548752a-4e1b-4ee4-a197-a6891c64eef7", "title": "Imagerie du traumatis\u00e9 abdomino-pelvien", "start": "2026-10-10T09:00+02:00", "end": "2026-10-10T09:15+02:00", "element": {"abstract": {"id": "F548752A-4E1B-4EE4-A197-A6891C64EEF7"}}, "speakers": {"items": [{"id": "58b96c68-381b-48e9-a26b-426f45e0949e", "lastName": "Emeric", "firstName": "Gremen", "roles": [{"name": "speaker"}], "photo": null, "country": {"name": "France"}, "city": {"name": "La Tronche"}}]}, "vod": {"checkPermissions": ["media:view"], "media": null}}, {"id": "68b25756-1157-4112-983c-cbf789698b7d",